Kogut <bulwersator@gmail.com> wrote:
> At least part of wishing methods in UN fail to provide magical items.

Wands of wishings (which can be generated randomly or one can be found
in the castle) are the only way of wishing for magical items.

> So, what may be interesting for wishing?

What about a stethoscope, a tinning kit, a t-shirt, a can of grease,
candles, a music instrument, a silver saber, an oilskin sack or an
oilskin cloak, an ice box or just money?

There are a lot of useful non-magical items in NetHack but they tend
to get overlooked because wishes grant you access to almost
everything.

